WEBVTT

00:01:58.847 --> 00:02:02.450
Alden ordered that more
journalists be cut.

00:02:03.109 --> 00:02:04.410
Again,

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:05.656
and again,

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:06.831
and again,

00:02:06.855 --> 00:02:08.069
and again.

00:02:08.093 --> 00:02:12.442
We were forced to say goodbye
to talented, hardworking journalists

00:02:12.466 --> 00:02:14.593
we considered not just friends

00:02:14.617 --> 00:02:15.974
but family.

00:02:16.593 --> 00:02:20.450
Those of us left behind
were stretched impossibly thin,

00:02:20.474 --> 00:02:24.253
covering multiple beats
and writing rushed articles.

00:02:25.371 --> 00:02:29.255
Inside a windowless meeting room
in March of 2018,

00:02:29.279 --> 00:02:32.794
we learned that 30 more would have to go.